"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1sxJp6QEPvLJqVwLHI2SOL15Yq6.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1sxJp6QEPvLJqVwLHI2SOL15Yq6.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/237150/season/1/episode/14"},{"id":"5645557","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"L'aspetto di un signore","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Ars and his retinue wrap up negotiations with the neighboring provinces, and upon their return home, Lord Couran gives Ars his most important and most dangerous mission to date... Does he have what it takes to face it?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-10-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tBe8bYaFomrtN4mPijn34a9srxJ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tBe8bYaFomrtN4mPijn34a9srxJ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/237150/season/1/episode/15"},{"id":"5645559","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Forte Vakmakro","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Under the leadership of Ars and Lumeire, Canarre's army attacks the Vakmakro fortress. Only by capturing it can they seize Castle Samkh and thereby conquer the entire district. However, the defenders of Vakmakro have come up with a surprising strategy...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-10-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1aiugXJxsDyJHbzwIctC5Zl2Cx9.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1aiugXJxsDyJHbzwIctC5Zl2Cx9.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/237150/season/1/episode/16"},{"id":"5645561","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Episodio 17","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The forces of Samkh remain defiant even after Fort Vakmakro falls. Ars and 